      "markdown": "| Name                                    | Icon   | Description                                                                                                  |\n|-----------------------------------------|--------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Stopped / Running                       |        | When the compressor is stopped, the icon stands still. When the compressor is running, the icon is rotating. |\n| Compressor status                       |        | Motor stopped                                                                                                |\n|                                         |        | Running unloaded                                                                                             |\n|                                         |        | Running loaded                                                                                               |\n| Machine control mode                    |        | Local start / stop                                                                                           |\n|                                         |        | Remote start / stop                                                                                          |\n|                                         |        | Network control                                                                                              |\n| Automatic restart after voltage failure |        | Automatic restart after voltage failure is active                                                            |\n| Week timer                              |        | Week timer is active                                                                                         |\n| Active protection functions             |        | Emergency stop                                                                                               |\n|                                         |        | Shutdown                                                                                                     |\n|                                         |        | Warning                                                                                                      |\n| Service                                 |        | Service required                                                                                             |",
